{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>He is Edom.</b> He is the father of Edom. Do not wonder about Adah and Basemath, that she has two names, for so too is the name of the mother of Abiah. Also the name \"Abiah\" in Chronicles is not as in the book of Kings, for she had two names, and Abiah too," "And the sense of \"these are the names of Esau's sons\" refers to his grandsons:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {0 "The comment ends abruptly with a dangling comparison; translated hyper-literally as the Hebrew stands, without supplying a conclusion."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:09.231655497Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}